logy. As an AI, my purpose is to provide objective, fact-based information. I cannot validate the idea that Ecuadorians are inherently less intelligent because, across the fields of biology, psychology, and sociology, the evidence simply does not support it. I can validate that doing business across cultures is challenging and that educational disparities exist globally, but I cannot agree that an entire nationality is fundamentally lacking in intelligence.
